\par\par \uc2 Australia news\par \b \uc2 Afternoon Update: \uc2 Penny Wong\uc2  condemns Israeli minister; unemployment rate jumps; and taking a \uc2 Tesla\uc2  for a swim\b0\par\par\uc2 Tony Harper \par \uc2 824 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 May 2026\par 07:33 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2026.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Want to get this in your inbox every weekday? Sign up for the Afternoon Update here, and start your day with our Morning Mail newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Good afternoon.\par \par \uc2 Australia\u8217\'20\'19s foreign affairs minister, \uc2 Penny Wong\uc2 , has condemned the actions of a far-right Israeli minister who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/20/israeli-security-minister-itamar-ben-gvir-stirs-diplomatic-outrage-with-flotilla-activist-abuse-video"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted a video of himself abusing}}}\uc2  bound activists captured while trying to sail an aid flotilla to Gaza.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/21/penny-wong-condemns-israeli-minister-over-shocking-and-unacceptable-treatment-of-flotilla-activists-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wong joined international condemnation}}}\uc2  of the footage, which shows Israel\u8217\'20\'19s national security minister, Itamar Ben-Gvir, waving an Israeli flag and mocking and taunting the detainees, including shouting \u8220\'20\'1Cthe people of Israel live\u8221\'20\'1D in the face of one bound man.\par \par \uc2 Among the flotilla detainees were 11 Australian activists who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/19/government-urgently-seeking-status-of-11-australian-gaza-flotilla-activists-detained-by-israel-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 were taken into custody by Israeli forces}}}\uc2  off the coast of Cyprus earlier this week, but it is not known if they were present in Ben-Gvir\u8217\'20\'19s video.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, Wong said \u8220\'20\'1Cthe images we have seen are shocking and unacceptable\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe condemn the actions of Israeli minister Ben-Gvir \u8211\'20\'13 who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2025/jun/10/uk-and-allies-sanction-two-far-right-israeli-ministers-itamar-ben-gvir-bezalel-smotrich-over-monstrous-gaza-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Australia has sanctioned }}}\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13 and the degrading actions of Israeli authorities towards those detained,\u8221\'20\'1D Wong said on Thursday morning.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI have asked Australia\u8217\'20\'19s ambassador to Israel to make representations to Israel, reiterating our call for the release of the detained Australians and for Israel to ensure no ill treatment of any detainees and to act in line with international obligations.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Top news\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/may/21/elon-musk-x-fined-failing-to-comply-child-safety-order-australia-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s X fined $650,000 after failing to comply with Australian child safety notice}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/may/21/australia-unemployment-rate-jumps-job-market-rba-reserve-bank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Australia\u8217\'20\'19s unemployment rate jumps to 4.5% in \u8216\'20\'18tentative signs labour market is buckling\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/may/21/queensland-olympics-minister-tim-mander-referred-afp-false-enrolment-allegationsp-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Olympics minister Tim Mander referred to AFP over electoral enrolment allegations}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/may/21/laser-hair-removal-device-sparks-bomb-scare-evacuation-melbourne-avalon-airport-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Terror on the hairlines: laser hair removal device sparks evacuation of Victoria\u8217\'20\'19s Avalon airport}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/may/21/man-charged-with-stealing-camera-equipment-from-bondi-shooting-victim-in-aftermath-of-terror-attack-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Man charged with stealing camera equipment from Bondi shooting victim in aftermath of terror attack}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/21/trump-taiwan-president-china-relations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump claims he will speak to Taiwan\u8217\'20\'19s president, departing from decades-long diplomatic norms}}}\par \par \uc2 In pictures\par \par \uc2 Authorities in Texas had to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/may/20/tesla-cybertruck-texas-lake-wade-mode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remove a Tesla Cybertruck from a lake}}}\uc2  after the driver intentionally drove into it in an attempt to try the vehicle\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cwade mode\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The vehicle became disabled and took on water, prompting the driver and passengers to abandon it before calling for help.\par \par \uc2 The driver was arrested on charges of operating a vehicle in a closed section of a park or lake, as well as several water safety equipment violations.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe want to remind drivers that although a vehicle may be physically capable of entering shallow freshwater areas, doing so can create legal and safety concerns under Texas law,\u8221\'20\'1D local police said.\par \par \uc2 What they said \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 ***\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re not gangsters, they are not people causing trouble, they are just normal people who want a good life\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 New Zealander Betty Wihongi, whose daughter Everlee has been detained by \uc2 US Immigration and Customs Enforcement\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Everlee Wihongi, 37, who moved to the US when she was six and holds a green card, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/21/everlee-wihongi-new-zealand-woman-ice-us-detention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was detained in Los Angeles on 10 April}}}\uc2 , after a family trip to New Zealand.\par \par \uc2 After an agonising seven-hour wait at the airport, Wihongi called her family saying there had been an issue with a historical conviction and she was being sent to an ICE processing facility in \uc2 Adelanto, California\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Wihongi had a conviction for possession of marijuana dating back more than a decade and she had travelled in and out of the country several times without issue.\par \par \uc2 Podcast\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/may/20/are-xi-and-putin-still-best-friends-the-latest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Are Xi and Putin still \u8216\'20\'18best friends\u8217\'20\'19? \u8211\'20\'13 The Latest}}}\par \par \uc2 Xi Jinping welcomed \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  to Beijing with pomp and pageantry, just days after hosting \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But as Russia\u8217\'20\'19s war in Ukraine makes Moscow increasingly dependent on China, and western leaders thaw relations with Beijing, Lucy Hough and the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s deputy head of international news, Devika Bhat, ask what the power imbalance means for Xi and Putin\u8217\'20\'19s relationship.\par \par \uc2 Before bed read\par \par \uc2 In 2010 Colin Chee picked up the keys to his tiny off-the-plan apartment in Melbourne\u8217\'20\'19s city centre.\par \par \uc2 With no design experience and a limited budget, his quest to find inspiration eventually led to the birth of Never Too Small, a \uc2 YouTube\uc2  channel showcasing clever designs for small spaces from around the world. Launched in 2017, it now has more than 3 million subscribers.\par 