\par\par \uc2 Technology\par \b \uc2 US tech firm \uc2 Oracle\uc2  cuts thousands of jobs as it steps up AI spending\b0\par\par\uc2 Dan Milmo and agency \par \uc2 432 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 April 2026\par 14:11 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par 33\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2026.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Company chaired by Trump ally \uc2 Larry Ellison\uc2  seeks to reassure investors that bet on AI infrastructure will pay off\par \par \uc2 Oracle\uc2  is cutting thousands of jobs as the US technology company seeks to reassure investors that its bet on AI infrastructure will pay off.\par \par \uc2 The $420bn (\u163\'00\'A3315bn) company, which is headquartered in Austin, Texas, started making employees redundant on Tuesday, with thousands of its 162,000-strong workforce expected to leave.\par \par \uc2 About 10,000 people have lost their jobs so far, the \uc2 BBC{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm296jzzl9yo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , citing an unnamed employee at the company, which is chaired by \uc2 Larry Ellison\uc2 , the billionaire ally of Donald Trump. Ellison is worth $189bn and is the world\u8217\'20\'19s sixth richest person, Forbes {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/real-time-billionaires/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimates}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Michael Shepherd, a senior manager at \uc2 Oracle\uc2 , who was not affected by the cuts, posted on the social media site \uc2 LinkedIn\uc2  that there had been a \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant reduction in force\u8221\'20\'1D at the business.\par \par \uc2 Shepherd said the decision had affected \u8220\'20\'1Csenior engineers, architects, operations leaders, program managers, and technical specialists with deep expertise in cloud infrastructure, government and sovereign cloud environments, and enterprise-scale systems\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Business Insider{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.com/read-oracle-layoff-email-employees-job-cuts-2026-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first reported the job cuts}}}\uc2 , which were announced via an email that said: \u8220\'20\'1CAfter careful consideration of \uc2 Oracle\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s current business needs, we have made the decision to eliminate your role as part of a broader organisational change.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Oracle\uc2  acknowledged some job losses on Tuesday, affecting 491 employees working remotely in Washington state in the US and at its Seattle offices.\par \par \uc2 The cuts come as \uc2 Oracle\uc2 , a business software company, steps up spending on datacentres \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/feb/23/new-datacentres-risk-doubling-uk-electricity-use-ofgem-peak-demand"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key infrastructure for developing and operating AI systems}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 in an effort to better compete with cloud rivals, such as \uc2 Alphabet\uc2  and \uc2 Amazon\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Oracle\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s plans include a $300bn datacentre deal with \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , the developer of ChatGPT, but investors have grown concerned about the billions of dollars of expenditure attached to its plans, which includes raising $50bn in new debt.\par \par \uc2 In a March filing, \uc2 Oracle\uc2  said it expected total costs tied to its 2026 restructuring plan to reach up to $2.1bn, largely owing to redundancies and related expenses.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, more than 70 tech companies have cut about 40,480 jobs so far this year, according to the tech redundancy site Layoffs.fyi, as companies increasingly reallocate resources towards artificial intelligence, heightening fears of AI-driven disruptions among workers.\par \par \uc2 Last month, Reuters reported that Meta was planning sweeping job cuts that could affect 20% or more of its workforce.\par \par \uc2 Oracle\uc2  declined to comment.Reuters contributed to this story\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020260401em41002jp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
