\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump administration sues Minnesota for allowing trans athletes in girls\u8217\'20\'19 sports\b0\par\par\uc2 Shrai Popat and Rachel Leingang in Minneapolis \par \uc2 410 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 March 2026\par 21:38 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2026.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Justice department claims state is violating Title IX \u8211\'20\'13 the federal law that prohibits sex-based discrimination\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US Department of Justice\uc2  sued {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/minnesota"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Minnesota}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s education department and the state\u8217\'20\'19s school athletics body on Monday for allowing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/transgender"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transgender}}}\uc2  athletes to compete in girls\u8217\'20\'19 sports.\par \par \uc2 In a lawsuit, the justice department claims that by making female student athletes compete against transgender girls, as well as share locker rooms and bathrooms with them, Minnesota is violating Title IX \u8211\'20\'13 the federal law that prohibits sex-based discrimination for any programs that receive federal funding.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMinnesota\u8217\'20\'19s policies and practices create unfair competition, deny girls equal educational opportunities, and expose girls to a hostile educational environment with heightened risks of physical injury and psychological harm,\u8221\'20\'1D the justice department argues in the suit filed on Monday.\par \par \uc2 Minnesota has fought against the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s efforts to remove transgender athletes from girls\u8217\'20\'19 sports.\par \par \uc2 The state {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ag.state.mn.us/Office/Communications/2025/04/22_EO_TitleIX.asp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed a lawsuit}}}\uc2  last year over Trump administration orders to recognize only two genders. The administration warned the state last September that laws allowing transgender athletes violated Title IX, but the state has not relented. Minnesota is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/sections/shots-health-news/2024/10/01/nx-s1-5103113/minnesota-trans-refuge-walz-vance-transgender-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considered}}}\uc2  a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrans refuge\u8221\'20\'1D state for its policies that recognize and support transgender people.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit is one of several Minnesota faces from the Trump administration, which has made the midwestern state a focus in his retribution campaign. The administration has threatened to withhold billions in federal education funds if Minnesota doesn\u8217\'20\'19t disallow transgender involvement in girls\u8217\'20\'19 sports.\par \par \uc2 Keith Ellison, the state\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic attorney general, called the Title IX lawsuit a \u8220\'20\'1Csad attempt to get attention over something that\u8217\'20\'19s already been in litigation for months\u8221\'20\'1D and said he will continue to fight against the Trump administration \u8220\'20\'1Cto stop them from bullying vulnerable children in Minnesota\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDonald Trump is currently facing an unpopular war that he launched, rising gas prices, massive health insurance price hikes, and a partial government shutdown caused in part by his ICE agents killing two Minnesotans in broad daylight,\u8221\'20\'1D Ellison said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CIt is astonishing that any president would try to target, shame, and harass children just trying to be themselves, let alone a president with so many actual problems to address.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 There are currently 27 states that restrict transgender athletes from participating in school sports consistent with their gender identity, according to the Williams Institute.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020260330em3u0073l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
