\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Manhattan commuters urged to work from home for weeks amid rail upgrade\b0\par\par\uc2 Victoria Bekiempis \par \uc2 527 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 February 2026\par 18:21 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2026.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Extensive works on key bridge in New Jersey \u8211\'20\'13 part of $16bn Gateway project \u8211\'20\'13 will disrupt rail services into New York\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/new-jersey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New Jersey}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s transit authority has urged commuters into Manhattan to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.njtransit.com/portalcutover"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 work from home}}}\uc2  for up to a month if possible because of a huge railroad upgrade that is expected to upend travel to New York City from Tuesday morning.\par \par \uc2 The national rail operator, \uc2 Amtrak\uc2 , will move some train traffic on to a new bridge, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/02/17/nyregion/nj-transit-amtrak-path-train"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to the New York Times}}}\uc2 , in a travel-snarling project that is expected to last until 15 March and will result in extensive delays and fewer trains under the Hudson River.\par \par \uc2 The work is part of the $16bn Gateway infrastructure project that Donald Trump has repeatedly tried to thwart. The trains currently travel over the 116-year-old Portal Bridge, which extends 961ft (293 meters) across the Hackensack River in New Jersey. As many as 200,000 people cross the bridge daily, the Times said, part of \uc2 Amtrak\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Northeast Corridor rail line, \u8220\'20\'1Cthe busiest in the Western Hemisphere\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Weekday rail service will be reduced to 178 trains daily, down from 332, NJ.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nj.com/news/2026/02/nj-transit-apologizes-after-canceling-27-trains-riders-advised-to-work-from-home-during-bridge-project.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , so that \uc2 Amtrak\uc2  crews can finish infrastructure and signaling work to enable one of the Northeast Corridor tracks to operate on the new crossing, to be called the Portal North Bridge.\par \par \uc2 Some trains that would normally arrive to Midtown Manhattan will be dispatched to Hoboken, New Jersey.\par \par \uc2 The bridge has reportedly suffered longstanding problems including fires and drawbridge malfunctions.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Portal Bridge has been a nemesis and a nightmare for decades for riders on the Northeast Corridor,\u8221\'20\'1D NJ Transit\u8217\'20\'19s CEO, Kris Kolluri, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abc7ny.com/post/nj-transit-trains-diverted-hoboken-due-portal-bridge-cutover-project/18611337/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  ABC 7 News. \u8220\'20\'1CIn the end there will be a brand new bridge for the first time in 116 years.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Some riders could take another train, the Path, to New York City, but the diversion is poised to spur extensive demand for this service. Transit officials in New Jersey have suggested that commuters work from home if they can.\par \par \uc2 The Gateway Project will also construct a new commuter rail tunnel under the Hudson, and revamp a highly trafficked century-old tunnel that was damaged in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/hurricane-sandy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hurricane Sandy}}}\uc2  in 2012 and requires frequent emergency repairs.\par \par \uc2 Trump continues threatening federal funding for Gateway. A federal judge recently reversed his Gateway funding freeze {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/feb/06/trump-penn-station-dulles-airport-renaming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 amid reports}}}\uc2  that he wanted Manhattan\u8217\'20\'19s Penn Station and Dulles airport near Washington named after him in exchange. (Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/donald-trump/trump-renaming-new-york-penn-station-dulles-gateway-tunnel-funds-rcna259267"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  others made the suggestion.)\par \par \uc2 The US president on Monday complained again about Gateway, writing on social media: \u8220\'20\'1CI am opposed to the future boondoggle known as \u8216\'20\'18Gateway,\u8217\'20\'19 in New York/New Jersey, because it will cost many BILLIONS OF DOLLARS more than projected or anticipated.\u8221\'20\'1D He said Gateway would be \u8220\'20\'1Cfinancially catastrophic for the region, unless hard work and proper planning is done, NOW, to avoid insurmountable future cost overruns.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Proponents {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gatewayprogram.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argue}}}\uc2  construction will create 20,000 jobs. While the federal government has since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gothamist.com/news/gateway-hudson-tunnel-gets-30m-after-funding-freeze-more-than-200m-still-disputed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  some money to Gateway after the court decision, officials say another Trump funding freeze would cause delays and job losses.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020260217em2h0050o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
