\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s immigration agenda worsening childcare crisis, lawmakers warn\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 503 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 February 2026\par 15:21 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2026.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Democrats questioned White House about immigration policies exacerbating childcare shortages and costs\par \par \uc2 Democratic lawmakers, led by the senators {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/elizabeth-warren"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elizabeth Warren}}}\uc2  and Tammy Duckworth and the representative \uc2 Mike Quigley\uc2 , are demanding answers about how {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s immigration policies are exacerbating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/money/childcare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 childcare}}}\uc2  shortages and costs in the US.\par \par \uc2 About 20% of the childcare workforce in the US are immigrants \u8211\'20\'13 and as high as 70% in some regions of the US \u8211\'20\'13 and the president\u8217\'20\'19s immigration policies could reduce the childcare workforce by an estimated 15%, according to a letter sent today by 48 lawmakers to the Department of Health and Human Services\u8217\'20\'19 Administration for Children and Families (ACF).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CImmigration policy changes \u8211\'20\'13 including terminations of temporary protected status (TPS), the elimination of other lawful immigration pathways, and immigration raids in and around childcare programs \u8211\'20\'13 are driving childcare providers out of the workplace, exacerbating childcare workforce shortages and high prices,\u8221\'20\'1D the lawmakers wrote in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.warren.senate.gov/imo/media/doc/warren_lawmakers_re-_impact_of_immigration_policies_on_child_care_workforce.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 letter}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The lawmakers provided examples of childcare workers ensnared by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s deportation push, including a nanny in Wisconsin, an asylum seeker with no criminal record who was detained by \uc2 Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE)\uc2  after a routine check-in, and immigrant teachers at a preschool in Washington DC who lost their work authorizations and were forced to quit due to TPS terminations by the Trump administration.\par \par \uc2 Trump also revoked protections for childcare facilities and other sensitive locations from ICE raids, and the letter cited cases in Chicago, Illinois and Minnesota, where ICE performed arrests or conducted \u8220\'20\'1Cvisits\u8221\'20\'1D to childcare sites, which have caused staff declines.\par \par \uc2 These impacts, the letter explains, have long-reaching effects on the rest of the US economy, causing parents to reduce work hours or leave the workforce altogether. The lawmakers are demanding to know how the agency is assessing the impacts of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s immigration policies on the childcare workforce and what the agency plans to do to prevent further disruptions and mitigate rising costs.\par \par \uc2 The lawmakers are demanding information from the ACF about how it is assessing and responding to the impacts the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s immigration agenda is having on the childcare industry.\par \par \uc2 The latest push to rein in the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s immigration policies comes as Democratic-led states have begun enacting free universal childcare. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.governor.state.nm.us/2025/09/08/new-mexico-is-first-state-in-nation-to-offer-universal-child-care/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New Mexico}}}\uc2  became the first state in the US to provide universal free childcare, in September 2025.\par \par \uc2 New York City\u8217\'20\'19s mayor, Zohran Mamdani, and the state\u8217\'20\'19s governor, \uc2 Kathy Hochul\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nyc.gov/mayors-office/news/2026/01/mayor-mamdani---governor-hochul-to-launch-free-child-care-for-tw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  last month free childcare programs and investments toward achieving universal free childcare in New York, and San Francisco, California, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jan/15/san-francisco-childcare-families"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 followed}}}\uc2  suit a week later.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, the representative \uc2 Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez\uc2  signed on as the lead in the House to Warren\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ct.symplicity.com/t/wrn/deb2fb3ba195af8ee6869522fe2ac846/crc_replacement/realurl=https:/*www.warren.senate.gov/newsroom/press-releases/warren-sherrill-40-lawmakers-renew-push-to-lower-child-care-costs__;Lw!!BSgrhSFG!FODjDOIKl6Uq0cs1BbxkOZqeL141k-JK7UzIr7SSDy4JCsSNTbUAbUedtbIBO8fH5EWSO1XbayFECQ7PNHK-i_YdH6xs$"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Child Care for Every Community Act}}}\uc2  to deliver universal childcare across the US, capping costs at $10 a day for half of all families and capping costs based on an income scale used in the US military\u8217\'20\'19s childcare program.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020260213em2d00568\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
